  "details": "I like listening to music when I'm on vrchat and the loading screen music kinda ruins my music so I have to have my volume mixer on to disable vrchat sound every time I load to a different world, and since I've got an hdd, it takes longer than usual to load so it's kinda annoying waiting for the loading to end so I can enable sound. I also sometimes forget to unmute vrchat and that's annoying as well. I wish it was automated, or better, togglable.",
